  "sourceTitle": "Blueberry Vodka Lemonade",
  "sourceText": "Blueberry Vodka Lemonade\nBy: Michael\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:28pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 ounces Blueberry Vodka\n6 ounces 7-up\n1 dash Lemon Juice\n3 Blueberries\nIce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place ice and liquid ingredients in a shaker. 2 Shake. 3 Pour into a martini glass. 4 Garnish with blueberries.\n\nAbout\n\n\nAdjust the lemon juice to taste.\nAlternatively, serve in a highball glass over ice.",
